    {
      "id": "claim_d5a04b16743d4afa9fb0e5d25cb2c6de",
      "statement": "manifold-train composes the experiment config, builds a cold data bundle whose VAE-encode warm is deferred to DataModule.setup() so it runs after the distributed process group is initialized and the per-rank i % world == rank sharding activates, then trains LatentFlowModule and writes full-state Lightning checkpoints. The resulting .ckpt requires the manifold-export bridge to become a native inference directory.",
