      "id": "claim_117354b1464340e8b9b842e181089071",
      "statement": "There are two artifact types: training .ckpt (full Lightning state for resume and selection) and native inference directory (deployable UNet/ControlNet/VAE/scheduler components loaded by a pipeline). Export is the sole supported bridge, via manifold-export with --pipeline {jit, paired, controlnet}; --pipeline paired is a stale reference because the PairedLatentFlowPipeline module was deleted alongside the paired-reward pipeline in ADR-0034.",
