      "statement": "EMA training was removed (ADR-0006 addendum). The export bakes raw UNet weights under the unet.unet. state-dict prefix and always reports \"unet_state_dict\". Reward and GRPO policy loading follow the same raw-weight contract; the single validation metric on the JiT path is val/fid, evaluated on the live raw model.",
