    {
      "id": "claim_3475477b68664e1ca3d0066651c05499",
      "statement": "A supervised ControlNet .ckpt carries only controlnet.* keys: the frozen base UNet is registered so Lightning owns device placement, but stripped from the state_dict and the checkpoint by FrozenArmMixin's state_dict override and load_state_dict's allow-list. Export bakes those controlnet.* keys into a fresh ControlNet built from the network config and restores the frozen base from --base-native-dir (the JiT native export the supervised stage trained against). A missing or unexpected controlnet.* key raises — there is no blanket strict=False.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0031-device-ownership.md",
