      "id": "claim_e40ef6b601264cafa687c5f898998c7c",
      "statement": "There are two native inference pipelines: LatentFlowPipeline (JiT noise-to-data UNet + VAE + scheduler) and ControlNetLatentFlowPipeline (frozen JiT base UNet + trainable ControlNet + VAE + scheduler). The previous PairedLatentFlowPipeline (the 2·C src→tgt UNet paired-JiT inference pipeline) was retired with the paired-reward pipeline in ADR-0034. The JiT and ControlNet pipelines share the per-component save_pretrained / from_pretrained contract and delegate sampling to the shared modules/{sampler, controlnet_sampler}.py primitives (ADR-0005).",
