      "id": "claim_037124edcf24479aa510092c6cba716a",
      "statement": "The ControlNet's direction conditioning is a learned MLP that combines source and target contrast embeddings via concat([embed(src), embed(tgt+offset)]) with the optional paired_direction_offset shifting the target embedding row to break A↔B symmetry. The base UNet sees only the target-contrast label; the ControlNet carries the translation direction.",
